{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Protective Warding: critical damage taken shortens Guarding Rune's cooldown (#905)",
  "contract": [
    "Protective Warding 800756 reads 'Critical damage taken reduces the cooldown of Rune of Guarding by $800753s1%.'",
    "Its only effect is PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL 800753, but Spell.dbc gives the passive ProcFlags 0, so SpellMgr",
    "generates no proc entry and it never fires. 800753's effect is Ascension effect 192, BasePoints 9 (10%),",
    "MiscValue 500464 (Guarding Rune, the talent the tooltip calls Rune of Guarding, 120 s cooldown); the core runs",
    "it through EffectNULL. The CoA convention for a percentage cooldown reduction (Templar Enlighten, the Sun Cleric",
    "and Venomancer cooldown talents) takes it from the remaining cooldown. Expected: every critical damage hit the",
    "Runemaster takes procs once and multiplies Guarding Rune's remaining cooldown by 0.9, so two or more crits during",
    "an 8 s beating leave at most 100 s of the 120 s cooldown, while a Runemaster without the talent keeps about 110",
    "s. The hostile players' hit, expertise and crit ratings make every swing a critical hit, since the harness's",
    "passive fixture creatures cannot attack. Non-critical hits are not measured: their chance cannot be fixtured."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
